00:00:01,809 --> 00:00:07,408
Instead of heating a junction, push a current round the same copper iron loop with a battery.

3
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:15,989
In eighteen thirty four, Jean Peltier found that one junction warms up, while the other actually cools down below room temperature.

